Move-invariance goldens of phase E (tests/core/test_move_invariance.py).

Record them on the E0 commit, never on an older tree (phases A-D change rewards, targets and the trainer on purpose):

    .venv/bin/python -I -c "import tests.core.test_move_invariance as t; t.record()"

invariance.json            platform independent: goldens 1 (reward value), 2 (target set hash), 5 (chain argv and
                           vision refs of the live plans) and 6 (resolved GRPOConfig). "fingerprint" (optional, with
                           the numpy, OpenCV and scipy versions) is compared only when those versions match.
invariance.<platform>.json goldens 3 (score_batch bits) and 4 (one FastGRPO update), named sys.platform-machine
                           (darwin-arm64, linux-x86_64, ...). Floats are float.hex strings. A platform without a file
                           skips. The darwin-arm64 run is the binding gate; the Linux files come from the first green
                           CI run and the owner commits them.
host_syncs.json            count of .item()/.cpu()/.tolist()/.numpy() per torch-importing module (test_layers.py).
tests_import_experiments.json  test files that import `experiments` (the list only shrinks; 0 at E8).
module_strings_stale.json  dotted objdel names in strings that already point nowhere (the list only shrinks).
old_names.json             E-G16 baseline: top-level definitions of each old module (OLD_MODULES in test_layers.py).
                           Re-record after a merge that changes one of them:
                           .venv/bin/python -I -c "import sys; sys.path.insert(0, '.'); import tests.core.test_layers as t; t.record_old_names()"

Lane merge (impl2, after E0): lanes branched before E0 change these on purpose, so the merged tree re-records only
what they changed. Golden 1: RewardV4 gains its `name` field (B3.3; the constants are unchanged). Golden 3: score_batch
gains the `loc` term (B3.2; the other keys keep their bits). Golden 6: reward_weights gains one 0 for the `loc` logger.
host_syncs: train/gpu_pixels.py (C1, 3 host-buffer and self-check sites). tests_import_experiments: the lanes' new
test files. module_strings_stale: test_repo_hygiene's forward name objdel.geom.rings (E3a).
